      "writtenOn": "2024-03-25T13:38:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "About this, why not just take the instanceId file descriptor in the config like instance image? Then you can internalize all the `if exist { read } else { allocate }` logic all somewhere instead of letting each caller repeats similar code?\n\nIf it\u0027s handled internally, you can also ensure that `allocateInstanceId` is always called for the instance ID creation. With the current config format, people are not always aware that `#allocateInstanceId` is required for the id creation.",
      "parentUuid": "454c9948_e2ddd25c",
